# yaml-language-server: $schema=https://aka.ms/winget-manifest.defaultLocale.1.12.0.schema.json

PackageIdentifier: SelvakumarEsra.SuperWhatsapp
PackageVersion: @VERSION@
PackageLocale: en-US
Publisher: Carmine Paolino
PublisherUrl: https://paolino.me/
PublisherSupportUrl: https://github.com/selvakumarEsra/superwhatsapp/issues
Author: Carmine Paolino
PackageName: SuperWhatsapp
PackageUrl: https://selvakumaresra.github.io/superwhatsapp/
License: MIT
LicenseUrl: https://github.com/selvakumarEsra/superwhatsapp/blob/v@VERSION@/LICENSE
Copyright: Copyright (c) 2026 Carmine Paolino
ShortDescription: A fast, lightweight, native WhatsApp client
Description: |-
  SuperWhatsapp is a small, fast WhatsApp client with no browser engine. It links to your phone as a companion device and keeps your chats in an encrypted archive on your computer. It sends and receives messages, photos, videos, voice messages, stickers and polls, holds several WhatsApp numbers in one window, and takes custom colour themes.
  SuperWhatsapp was previously called FastsApp. It is not affiliated with WhatsApp or Meta.
  It needs a graphics driver with OpenGL 2.1 or newer.
Moniker: superwhatsapp
Tags:
- chat
- messaging
- messenger
- whatsapp
- whatsapp-client
ReleaseNotesUrl: https://github.com/selvakumarEsra/superwhatsapp/releases/tag/v@VERSION@
Documentations:
